 "notes": "Paper 'RoNIN LSTM' == official --type lstm_bi == BilinearLSTMSeqNetwork: 'bi' means BILINEAR, the LSTM is UNIDIRECTIONAL (bidirectional=False). Input is batch-first (B,T,6) [gyro,acc] (the IPB port must transpose from (B,6,T)); output is per-frame (B,T,2) velocity. Bilinear(6,6,24) -> concat -> LSTM(30,100,3 layers) -> concat(input_mix, h) -> Linear(130,10) -> Linear(10,2) with NO activation between the linears. Official hidden state is zero-initialised with a batch size fixed at construction (B must equal batch_size).",
